From 11ca9a908d07441c40dc4f0dd5ed69905697ea4a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mminin <mminin2010@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:53:17 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] XFA: Preserve filled forms and scripts across saving and
 reopening

Save the original XDP together with a versioned form DOM snapshot. Restore values, instance-manager prototypes, visibility and rich text without rerunning initialization. Reconnect script objects so saved forms can regenerate letters. Cover file and FD saves with repeated reopen, edit and scripted row-creation tests; add an explicit reusable-form CLI export.

AI-Assistant: OpenAI Codex
AI-Model: gpt-6.1-sol
AI-Reasoning-Effort: high
Co-authored-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
---
